WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:02,890
I want to ask you to borrow fire

2
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:03,890
Don't you have fire?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,200
Camps have been grouped

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,200
We didn't find the food we wanted for blood pressure today

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,800
He doesn't want to borrow fire, so what?

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,400
The internal fighting on your side has killed the fire.

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,600
What does it have to do with me

8
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,000
Fire is not a desert island fire brigade

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I can exchange it for labor

10
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,810
I don't lack the firewood trains you can make now

11
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:21,810
Let me beg you

12
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,410
I'm not alone tonight

13
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,410
You make conditions

14
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:26,610
As long as I can do it now

15
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:29,210
When I took out the 1.2 million watch, I didn’t even see you asking for it.

16
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,300
Now a torch

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,100
Burn away your arrogance

18
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,500
Because if there is no fire tonight

19
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,100
I'm not the only one who loves to move

20
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,900
There are still a few people who haven’t had enough to eat for two days.

21
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,300
If you catch the cold again, you will easily get sick, so

22
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,300
You make conditions

23
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,500
As long as I can do whatever I can do now

24
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,660
But the route is kept secret

25
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,860
What do you mean, blindfolding is just blindfolding

26
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:54,780
Otherwise, what about Queen Zhang?

27
00:00:54,780 --> 00:01:00,110
Did you just have a whole drama going on in your head? Shut up and go.

28
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:01,510
If you keep talking nonsense, I will regret it.

29
00:01:01,510 --> 00:01:04,110
Now you are begging me to lend you fire to lead the way
